NG`）主动返回 HTTP 500 并退出。Tracing 的 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 属性与日志中的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式高度一致，确证了应用逻辑导致的主动崩溃，而非资源不足或系统错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码依赖的配置项缺失 (未确认具体字段) → 应用处理请求时抛出 CONFIG_MISSING 错误并返回 500 → 应用进程因退出码 78 终止 → 容器持续进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 中的 `app` 容器处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 1, 2）。根本原因在于应用代码在运行时无法获取必要的配置项，导致在处理 `/work` 请求时抛出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误并返回 HTTP 500（证据 5, 7）。应用进程随后以退出码 78 主动终止（证据 3, 7），引发 kubelet 不断重启容器（证据 8），最终形成循环崩溃。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实**：\n尽管根因已定位为“配置缺失”，但尚未明确具体缺失的配置项名称（unknowns）。输入数据未包含 `ConfigMap 'workload-code'` 的内容或应用期望读取的具体环境变量/文件路径，因此无法指出是哪一个具体的键（key）缺失导致了应用启动或运行失败。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 84.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 84.3s (Evidence 75.5s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 16.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 124.338, "metrics": {"run_id": "ef689c2ddfd14eec", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 124.34466505050659, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "57%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "d